WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,220
They are not asking for help

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,660
They have their own exchange there

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,260
It turns out that everyone is looking for a way out for themselves

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,860
I'm the only one still asking for secrets for others

5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:14,490
I'm too lazy to take it seriously

6
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:17,050
Then add some chips and say it first, don't go too far.

7
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,130
If you lose, put on a show

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,370
Just do a little extra work

9
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,490
Don't play dangerous

10
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,690
Don't gamble with food either

11
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,290
When did you become so civilized?

12
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:30,180
Because food is not a toy after Big Brother

13
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,140
bring this

14
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:34,060
Sing a sweet and greasy song Xu Rouer

15
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,460
You better not lose the next round
